# remove 195 files of 19,479 (~1%). That is a CORRECTNESS fix — wrong symbol answers —
# and NOT a cure for `analyze` exceeding GITNEXUS_ANALYZE_TIMEOUT_MS. The timeout kill
# leaves crash residue that segfaults every read, and that is handled unconditionally by
# cleanCrashResidue() in
# packages/operator-core/lib/harness/routines/gitnexus-reindex-action.ts (plan D-016).
